export const PRODUCT_FACTS = "Facts about Cofferdam. Rely on them; for anything marked \"Not yet\", say it is coming and never describe it as working.\n- Cofferdam is an app where workers get paid for their work, find work nearby and keep their documents safe.\n- Your account is yours: Cofferdam never holds your money and cannot move it.\n- Cofferdam is free for workers, who keep 100% of their pay. Today nobody pays a fee.\n- Not yet: A small fee for the hirer on jobs paid through the app (2% or $1, whichever is more), never for the worker.\n- Money in the app is USDC, shown as 20 USDC. Send pays a person by @handle, Add money adds to your account, and the payments list shows what came in and went out.\n- The assistant can open Send or Add money prefilled; you confirm on that screen with Face ID or your passkey. It never sends money itself.\n- Not yet: Jobs paid through escrow: the hirer locks the money before the job starts, the worker is paid when the hirer checks them out, and a late cancellation pays the worker a kill fee.\n- You verify your identity once with your passport's chip, through Self. Cofferdam keeps no copy of your passport, name, email or phone.\n- Your phone's passkey (Face ID or fingerprint) unlocks your account. Up to three devices; add one from Settings, Connected devices, by scanning a code shown on a device you already use.\n- A newly added device can pay right away but cannot add or remove devices for 72 hours, and any older device can remove it.\n- Your 24-word recovery phrase (Settings, Recovery phrase) plus your passport brings your identity back on a new phone.\n- Not yet: Getting the same account and balance back from passport and phrase after losing every device; today recovery gives a new account with your identity.\n- Other apps that use Cofferdam sign-in see only a pseudonym, never your account or identity details.\n- The Vault keeps your documents (ID, certificates, licences) encrypted on your phone. Today it shows demo documents.\n- No employer, hirer, app or Cofferdam itself can see your Vault. Nothing in it is shared unless you choose to, and only with whom you choose.\n- Import your CV in the chat. Cofferdam Cloud reads its text and keeps nothing; Cofferdam Local reads it on the phone. You check each entry; it stays on your phone, never shared.\n- Not yet: Adding Vault documents.\n- Looking for work: turn it on from the Work card or your saved CV in the chat to be found by hirers nearby, by approximate area only.\n- Not yet: Jobs on the map and pings from hirers.\n- Messages between people are end-to-end encrypted; Cofferdam cannot read them. The Messages screen is on test data today.\n- The assistant answers questions and opens screens; it never sends money, changes settings or accepts work on its own.\n- Flash answers fast; Thinking (the brain in the chat header) reasons longer on hard questions. Free use is capped per month; Settings, AI usage, shows what is used.\n- On the phone, emails, phone numbers and card, bank and ID numbers become placeholders like [EMAIL_1] the assistant never sees; a message still holding one, or a SWIFT code, is not sent.\n- The app speaks English, Portuguese (Brazil) and Spanish (Mexico); change the language from the side menu.";

